Package: ctlyrics
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MRsoymilk <codermrsoymilk@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: cmus, fontconfig, libc6, libgcc-s1, python3, xdg-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/MRsoymilk/ctlyrics
Description: terminal lyrics viewer and mapping manager for cmus
 ctlyrics displays synchronized LRC lyrics for the current cmus track. It
 includes a terminal interface, Web mapping manager, desktop tray integration,
 Wayland and X11 lyric bubbles, and helper tools for downloading and mapping
 lyrics.
